@startuml deployment-auth
' Đồ án: Công nghệ Phần mềm - ĐH Sài Gòn (SGU)
' Tác giả: Nguyễn Hữu Chí Công - MSSV: 3124720010 (Thành viên 5)
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6

title Sơ đồ Triển khai (UML Deployment Diagram) – Nút CI/CD Pipeline, Cấu hình SSL/HTTPS & Environment Secrets / JWT Keys

node "<<device>> Thiết bị Người dùng\n(Mobile / Desktop Client)" as ClientDevice {
    node "<<execution environment>> Web Browser (PWA)" as Browser {
        artifact "Next.js AuthModal & Navbar\n(React 18 / TailwindCSS)" as AuthUI
        artifact "Zustand Persist Storage\n(localStorage: user, accessToken)" as TokenStore
    }
}

node "<<CI/CD platform>> Nút Đường ống Tích hợp Liên tục\n(GitHub Actions CI/CD Pipeline)" as CICDNode {
    artifact "GitHub Repository\n(Branch: main & Pull Requests)" as GitRepo
    node "<<runner>> GitHub Actions Runner (ubuntu-latest)" as GHARunner {
        component "Job 1: Backend CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml)\n[npm install -> npx prisma generate -> npm run build -> jest]" as BackendCI
        component "Job 2: Frontend CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml)\n[npm install -> next build -> Type-check]" as FrontendCI
    }
    storage "<<vault>> Environment Secrets Vault\n- JWT_SECRET (HS256 Signing Key)\n- DATABASE_URL (PostgreSQL Credentials)\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL" as SecretsVault
}

cloud "<<edge network>> Lớp Bảo mật Mạng & SSL/HTTPS\n(Cloudflare / Reverse Proxy Ingress)" as SSLIngress {
    component "SSL / TLS 1.3 Termination\n(HTTPS Port 443 -> HTTP Internal)" as TLSTermination
    component "Bearer Token Header Forwarding\n(Authorization: Bearer <JWT>)" as HeaderProxy
}

node "<<docker host>> Máy chủ Production Runtime\n(Docker Compose Engine)" as DockerHost {
    node "<<container>> brewlite_frontend\n(Next.js 14 Container - Port 3000)" as FrontendContainer {
        component "Next.js App Router Server\n(SSR / CSR Auth Flow)" as NextApp
    }

    node "<<container>> brewlite_backend\n(NestJS 10 Container - Port 4000)" as BackendContainer {
        component "AuthModule (AuthController & AuthService)\n[POST /auth/register, POST /auth/login, GET /auth/me]" as AuthComp
        component "Passport JwtStrategy & JwtAuthGuard\n[getJwtSecret() & Role RBAC Verification]" as GuardComp
        component "Bcrypt Crypto Engine\n[Salt Rounds = 10]" as BcryptComp
    }

    node "<<container>> brewlite_postgres\n(PostgreSQL 16 Alpine - Port 5432)" as PostgresContainer {
        database "Database: brewlite\n[Table: users (email @unique, passwordHash, role, loyaltyPoints)]" as UsersDB
        storage "<<volume>> postgres_data\n(Persistent Volume)" as PgVolume
    }
}

' Luồng giao tiếp & triển khai
GitRepo --> GHARunner : Push / Pull Request Trigger
GHARunner --> DockerHost : Build & Deploy Docker Images\n(docker compose up -d --build)
SecretsVault ..> BackendContainer : Inject Runtime Secrets\n(JWT_SECRET, DATABASE_URL)

ClientDevice --> SSLIngress : HTTPS (TLS 1.3 - Port 443)\n[Encrypted Credentials & JWT]
SSLIngress --> FrontendContainer : Proxy Web Traffic (:3000)
SSLIngress --> BackendContainer : Proxy API Requests (:4000)\n[Authorization: Bearer <JWT>]

AuthComp --> BcryptComp : Hash / Compare Password
AuthComp --> GuardComp : Sign & Verify JWT (HS256)
AuthComp --> UsersDB : Prisma TCP Connection Pool (:5432)
UsersDB ..> PgVolume : Mount /var/lib/postgresql/data

note bottom of SecretsVault
  <b>Quản lý Khóa Bí mật (NFR-DEP-05):</b>
  - Khóa <i>JWT_SECRET</i> tuyệt đối không hard-code trong Git.
  - Hàm <i>getJwtSecret()</i> kiểm tra biến môi trường ngay khi khởi động;
    nếu thiếu sẽ dừng tiến trình ngay lập tức (Fail-fast).
end note

@enduml
